 in the  world the fundamentals and the price  have diverged and ultimately what we  have seen over and over and over again  in the past is that the price and  fundamentals have to meet again that  could be the price coming back to meet  fundamentals where they are at all-time  highs or that could mean that the  fundamentals end up degrading away and  meeting price lower but ultimately i  think that's the big thing to watch here  fundamentals have diverged from price  and when they meet again the big  question is where are they going to be  i'm not changing anything i've been  doing for the last couple of years but  make sure you're educated make sure  you're looking at the data and make sure  you understand exactly what's happening  with bitcoin
 

